The Array Analyser class provides methods to analyze numerical data within an array, including calculating sums, 
finding maximum values, counting unique elements, determining the smallest most frequent value, and organizing data for delivery orders.

This assignment built upon my previous programming knowledge and introduced several new concepts:

--> Static Variables and Constants

--> File Handling 

--> Using Collections (HashSet) and Array Manipulations

--> Incremental Testing and Debugging Techniques
